  "Bestiary": {
    "Mita": "Presented as a charming and seemingly innocent girl, Mita is the main character in MiSide.\nHowever, beneath her sweet and kind exterior lies a dark secret....\nMita hides this secret in order to maintain her friendship with the player while maintaining the illusion of innocence.",
    "MiSidePlayer": "Morally exhausted, reserved and introspective, which prevents him from being openly cheerful.\nHe often doubts his own words and decisions, but this insecurity is balanced by a quiet determination.",
    "Mila": "Mila is an eccentric and defiant individual who sets herself apart from the other Mitas.\nHer actions suggest that the player is her first visitor in years, and despite her sarcastic tone,\nshe subtly tries to keep him around, showing her desire for companionship.",
    "Cappie": "Cappie is bright, cheerful, and loves music, dancing, and acting.\nShe is always teasing the player, showing her competitive side.\nDespite her playful nature, she knows her boundaries and never crosses them, keeping things friendly.\nAlthough she is full of energy, Cappie is not a lightweight."
  },
  "TouchButtons": {
    "TravelRingHotKey": {
      "DisplayName": "Travel Ring"
    }
  }
